Ewean
$cards
DECK 4 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
DRAW 77 DEAL {WAYEC, AREAS}
WAYEC 5 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

AREAS 8 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
AREAS 6 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
AREAS 8 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE_STACK {AREAS, WAYEC} WAYEC
SRC Suit {HEARTS, DIAMONDS}
DRAW
PILE ANY WAYEC Size > 0
$win
OR
    PILE ALL AREAS Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL AREAS Empty
        PILE ALL AREAS Empty
